SMT solver library\n- **Installation**: You can install the Python wrapper for Z3 for the latest release from pypi\n\n### Recent Version History\n\nPrior releases include version 4.15.8.0 on Feb 12, 2026, followed by versions 4.15.7.0, 4.15.6.0, and 4.15.5.0 in early February (which were yanked due to missing Linux wheels).\n\nThe latest version 4.16.0 includes various improvements to the solver and API across different language bindings including Python, C++, Java, and C#.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"7e43f017-b9b1-44e2-98ce-03217972590c","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:36:52.753Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"88c8aa7e-55a0-49d9-8c15-7bb20255319c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
