{"parentUuid":"1e1611c9-0e45-48de-9407-1f3a8f4bcd3c","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"ab56e030d7ec24cad","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YGadufBj9pnYzvE5pTKvxC","type":"tool_result","content":"# QF_LIA Single Query Track Rankings\n\n## Top 3 Solvers (Sequential Performance)\n\n1. **OpenSMT** - 4,579 correct score\n2. **cvc5** - 4,443 correct score\n3. **Yices2** - 4,395 correct score\n\n## PAR-2 Scores\n\nThe results tables provided use \"CPU Time Score\" and \"Wall Time Score\" rather than traditional PAR-2 metrics. OpenSMT led with a CPU Time Score of 272,280.40.\n\n## How cvc5 and Z3 Ranked\n\n**cvc5** placed second overall with 4,443 problems solved correctly, trailing OpenSMT by 136 solutions.\n\n**Z3-alpha** ranked fourth with 4,271 correct solutions (273 more than its base version), while the non-competing Z3-alpha-base reference solver achieved 3,998 correct solutions."}]},"uuid":"fe0d8d02-7165-4331-aec1-a248e000f600","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:32.962Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1e1611c9-0e45-48de-9407-1f3a8f4bcd3c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"f1195762-858f-401e-b189-1f34bd9a0e5d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"ab56e030d7ec24cad","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HJ87jHf7pmoAGgxmZuanqC","type":"tool_result","content":"The server returned HTTP 404 Not Found.\n\nThe response body was not retrieved. If this URL requires authentication, use an authenticated tool (e.g. `gh` for GitHub, or an MCP-provided fetch tool) instead of WebFetch."}]},"uuid":"f26852b4-4884-4613-9a51-c8733fb28a98","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:33.313Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f1195762-858f-401e-b189-1f34bd9a0e5d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"957c3f03-e4ad-4af2-84ac-0bfd53b4f009","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"ab56e030d7ec24cad","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VDmSymp5SRDSJm8vNzxegK","type":"tool_result","content":"# SMT-COMP 2025 QF_BV Single Query Rankings\n\n## Top 3 Solvers (Sequential Performance)\n\n1. **Bitwuzla-MachBV** - 10,523 correct solutions\n2. **Bitwuzla** - 10,498 correct solutions\n3. **Yices2** - 10,491 correct solutions\n\n## Other Notable Performers\n\n- **cvc5** ranked 4th with 9,938 correct solutions\n- **Z3-alpha** ranked 6th with 8,970 correct solutions\n- **z3siri** ranked 5th with 9,308 correct solutions\n\nThe competition evaluated solvers on \"10703 benchmarks\" with a \"1200 seconds\" time limit across multiple performance metrics including CPU time, wall time, and solved instance counts for both satisfiable and unsatisfiable problems."}]},"uuid":"d56016cb-f11d-4142-b6d8-ecad705d7b84","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:33.711Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"957c3f03-e4ad-4af2-84ac-0bfd53b4f009","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"d56016cb-f11d-4142-b6d8-ecad705d7b84","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ab56e030d7ec24cad","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01YJzb65fvDP1EybTSzabLpM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have enough data. Let me compile the verdict.\n\n## CPMpy\n- 版本：R5 调研时 `0.9.24`(2025-01) → 现在 `0.10.0`(2026-01-19)，6 个 patch（0.9.25–0.9.29）+ 1 个 minor 全部落地。\n- MUS API：稳定。`cpmpy.tools.explain` 提供 `mus()`(deletion)、`quickxplain()`、`marco()` 枚举 MUS/MCS、`ocus()`，需要 solver 支持 assumptions（ortools/exact/z3/pysat 都支持）。半年内 API 没变。\n- 新增：v0.10.0 加了 RC2 MaxSAT backend、pindakaas CNF 编码、Bool×Int linearisation、OR-Tools 9.15 兼容修复（项目当前正用 9.15.6755，零成本）。\n- 契合度：4 day 估值仍有效甚至偏保守。`from cpmpy.tools.explain import quickxplain` 一行即用，且 OR-Tools 9.15 已对齐——PoC 可压到 1-2 day。\n\n## cvc5\n- 版本：R3 调研时 `1.2.x` → 现在 `1.3.4`(2026-05-07)，半年 5 版（1.3.0/1/2/3/4）。\n- 关键变更：1.3.0 多线程 `TermManager`、SMT-LIB 2.7 BV↔Int 转换；1.3.2 distinct lazy、NL arith schema；1.3.4 `--solve-bv-as-int` 支持 quantifier+UF、CaDiCaL 全 proof。Python binding `pip install cvc5==1.3.3` 直接可用，1.3.1 做了 unicode API 迁移（`std::wstring`→`u32string`，C++ 层面，Python 不破坏）。\n- SMT-COMP 2025 QF_LIA：cvc5 第 2（OpenSMT 第 1, Yices2 第 3）；QF_BV：cvc5 第 4（Bitwuzla 系前三）。binding 子问题主要是 BoolVar+element+cardinality（基本是 QF_LIA 风格），cvc5 仍然是综合最佳通用选项。\n\n## Z3\n- 版本：→ `4.16.0`(2026-02-19)，半年内 4.15.4–4.15.8 + 4.16.0。\n- 改进：bit-rotation 更好的 bit-blasting、EUF AC completion、euf-completion proof、NL arith lemma throttling。Python API 无 breaking change。\n- 相对位置：QF_LIA Z3-alpha 第 4（cvc5 第 2 之后）；QF_BV Z3-alpha 第 6（cvc5 第 4）。混合 Bool+Int 我们这种规模 cvc5 大概率更快，但 Z3 通用性 + 工具链成熟度仍是 fallback 首选。\n\n## SMT-COMP 2025 关键\n- QF_LIA：OpenSMT 1, cvc5 2, Yices2 3, Z3-alpha 4\n- QF_BV：Bitwuzla-MachBV/Bitwuzla 1-2, Yices2 3, cvc5 4\n- QF_LRA：未取到（page 404 / 数据未爬到，但与项目相关性低）\n- 信号：binding 子问题（QF_LIA 风格）想最快可考虑 OpenSMT，但 cvc5 综合（API+文档+多 logic）仍最稳。\n\n## verdict\n- **P2 #18 MUS via CPMpy**：工时从 4d 缩到 **1-2d**。CPMpy 0.10.0 MUS API 稳定 + OR-Tools 9.15 已对齐 + `quickxplain`/`marco`/`ocus` 现成可调，wire-up + 测试足够。\n- **P3 cvc5 binding 替换**：仍维持 P3，**不升 P2**。cvc5 1.3.4 工程进展平稳但无颠覆性提升；binding 子问题当前在 CP-SAT 不是瓶颈，作 audit 通道仍合理但不紧迫。次选可记录 OpenSMT 在 QF_LIA 微弱领先 cvc5 一档。\n- **推荐立即可做的 MUS PoC：是**。1-2d 成本 + 稳定 API + 已对齐版本，无理由再等。\n\nSources:\n- [CPMpy Releases (GitHub)](https://github.com/CPMpy/cpmpy/releases)\n- [cpmpy on PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/cpmpy/)\n- [CPMpy explain tools docs](https://cpmpy.readthedocs.io/en/simpl_bool_fix/api/tools/explain.html)\n- [cvc5 Releases (GitHub)](https://github.com/cvc5/cvc5/releases)\n- [cvc5 on PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/cvc5/)\n- [Z3 Releases (GitHub)](https://github.com/Z3Prover/z3/releases)\n- [SMT-COMP 2025 home](https://smt-comp.github.io/2025/)\n- [SMT-COMP 2025 QF_LIA single query](https://smt-comp.github.io/2025/results/qf_lia-single-query/)\n- [SMT-COMP 2025 QF_BV single query](https://smt-comp.github.io/2025/results/qf_bv-single-query/)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":117,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1114,"cache_read_input_tokens":39607,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1114,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CasshCAMg58aWoEo3KGbr","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"d73cab90-399a-4536-9090-e9a477ca21c5","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:38:09.962Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
